Chapter: ScreenRecorderTimedTest
  cites Dev chapter ScreenRecorder
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 No capture is asked for: codex-vm's own -record-every-ms clock saves the
 frames, and the cap of 4 stops it, so the count read back is 4 however
 fast the box runs.

Section: Entry

  srt-wait : Integer -> [Device.Port] Integer
  srt-wait (fuel) = act
    n <- sr-frames-saved
    if n >= 4 | fuel <= 0 then n else srt-wait (fuel - 1)
  end

  opening : [Console, Device.Port] Nothing = act
    n <- srt-wait 5000000
    print-line-uni ("timed: saved " & show n)
  end